  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside years flow execution formation, Xia Cha gathers Gu aura into an immortal killer move and launches a jade-green pair of scissors as large as an elephant at an immemorial year rooster’s neck. The cut feels like spring: warm wind, bright sun, and fragrant grass and flowers, then a deep wound opens and blood sprays. Hidden Fang Yuan names the move Xia Cha’s spring scissors, calls it a rank eight offensive killer move sharp enough that the rooster’s sturdy body cannot stop it, and notes it is one of four killer moves in her set. One cast leaves the immemorial year rooster heavily injured all over.",
      "chapters": [
        1602
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xia_cha",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After soul searching Xia Cha, Fang Yuan lists her battle set as spring scissors, summer fan, autumn perception, and winter coat, involving Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter Immortal Gu. Spring scissors and summer fan are extremely ferocious and fully display rank eight might. Spring and Summer Immortal Gu are both rank eight and need rank eight immortal essence to activate.",
      "chapters": [
        1617
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seasonal-battle-set",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_summer_fan",
        "move_winter_coat",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Facing Southern Border Gu Immortals, Fang Yuan’s aura rises to rank eight; he points a finger and casts Spring Scissors, then pairs it with Summer Fan. Spring scissors suppress Jun Shen Guang while summer fan blocks the Southern Border immortals’ killer moves, and Xia clan rank sevens recognize Lady Xia Cha’s methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1624
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
